<title>ITALY: Italian M2 grew average 3.1 pct in Nov - BOI.</title>
<headline>Italian M2 grew average 3.1 pct in Nov - BOI.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian money supply as measured by M2 grew 3.1 percent year-on-year in November, compared with an average rise of 3.8 percent in October, the Bank of Italy said.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2505</p>
</text>
